    "name": "Benchmark Email RESTful API v3.0 ABTest Creation Help API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "RESTful API for managing email marketing contacts, lists, campaigns, automations, reports, images, and webhooks within the Benchmark Email platform. To use the API, you need a Benchmark Email API token available at https://ui.benchmarkemail.com/Integrate#API. Rate limit: 500 calls per 2 minutes and 60,000 calls per day.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Benchmark Email Developer Support",
